OL,13,     FThe Desert: Laurence Olivier
OL,14,     Fnarrates this exhaustive account
OL,15,     Fof World War II. In the deserts of
OL,16,     FNorth Africa, the 8th Army battles
OL,17,     Fagainst Rommel's Afrika Korps.
